# The Supabase URL and anon key, emitted by tools/build_static.py from the
# environment. Ignored for the same reason study/.gitignore ignores its own:
# a credential -- even a publishable one -- should be injected at deploy time,
# not committed. The GitHub Pages workflow (.github/workflows/pages.yml) and the
# Amplify build both generate it; a fresh checkout has no config.json, which is
# why tools/local_server.py serves one of its own.
static/config.json

# The `?labels=1` pair, emitted by tools/build_static.py: the item -> arm
# mapping and a copy of tools/debug_labels.js. Generated rather than committed
# so tools/debug_labels.js stays the single copy of the labelling code, and so
# the mapping cannot fall behind data/items.json.
static/__debug_arms.json
static/debug_labels.js
